--- Phase 1: variables and printing

--- Line comment

---
This is
a block comment
*---

--- Variable declarations (aliases and full names)
i: x = 2;
f: pi = 3.14;
s: city = "Warsaw";
b: status = true;

int: y = 5;
float: eural = 2.71828;
str: surname = "Smith";
bool: active = false;

--- Printing values
>! x;
>! pi;
>! city;
>! status;
>! y;
>! eural;
>! surname;
>! active;

--- String concatenation
str: helper = "World";
>! "Hello" + " " + helper;

--- Adding numbers
i: sum = 10;
>! sum + y;
